# VED ownership

Canon: `docs/knowledge/branches.md` · `src/lib/ved/PACKAGES.md` · `plan-parallel-ownership.md`.

| Area | Put code in |
|------|-------------|
| Client / broker / manufacturer panes | `src/components/ved/{client,broker,manufacturer}/*` |
| Cabinets | orchestration only (`*Cabinet.tsx`) |
| Session API | `app/api/v1/*` · domain extract `containers/api` |
| domain / orch / mesh / draft | see `PACKAGES.md` |
| `containers/llm` · `containers/ocr` | Compose **mirrors** of sibling `llm` repo — `npm run sync:ai-matrix` |

## Multi-model

- **Model ≠ container.** Vendors = `AI_CHAIN_ID` / env profiles (`llm/chains/*`).
- **Capability = service** (classification, ocr, …). One HTTP envelope each.
- UI never calls matrix URLs.

## Forbidden

- `@prisma/client` in `containers/{broker,client,admin,manufacturer}`
- Parallel C3+C4 extracts in one change (D19)
- Docker service per vendor
